Approvals
🔹 Jenkins Pipeline — Manual Approval
I am replicating how to pause pipeline until manual approval.

groovy
pipeline {
    agent any
    environment {
        INSTITUTE_NAME = "Prasanta Pathnex"
    }
    stages {
        stage('Deploy') {
            steps {
                input message: "Approve deployment for $INSTITUTE_NAME?"
                sh 'echo "Deployment approved and executed!"'
            }
        }
    }
}
🔹 GitLab CI — Manual Approval Job
I am replicating how to use manual jobs in GitLab CI for approvals.

yaml
stages:
  - deploy

variables:
  INSTITUTE_NAME: "Prasanta Pathnex"

deploy:
